OL,3,GNEWSAFire service fighting wild fire
OL,4,A'on two fronts'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire service has confirmed it is
OL,7,Fbattling a "large field fire" on the
OL,8,Foutskirts of a town that is being
OL,9,Ftreated as "suspicious".
OL,11,FDevon and Somerset Fire and Rescue
OL,12,FService said it had six fire appliances
OL,13,Ftackling the five-hectare blaze in
OL,14,FNorton Fitzwarren, near Taunton, "on
OL,15,Ftwo fronts" as it had spread over
OL,16,Ffields and into woodland.
OL,18,FThe fire service said it was called out
OL,19,Fat about 14:00 BST and used a drone to
OL,20,Fmonitor the fire while crews used hose
OL,21,Freel jets, fire beaters and water
OL,22,Fbackpacks.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
